window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>One broken human-ish girl.</b></p> <p><b>Twelve gorgeous supernatural bachelors.</b></p> <p><b>A paranormal dating game with bite.</b></p> <p>What’s a half-wolf girl to do when her fated mate rejects her?</p> <p>Apparently, go on a supernatural reality dating show.</p> <p>Twelve hunky bachelors are vying for my attention and my heart.</p> <p>Including my ex’s twin brother....</p> <p>It’s the perfect recipe for revenge.</p> <p>But my desire to get back at those who hurt me is a lot harder with all the drama the other suitors bring.</p> <p>And when I start developing real feelings for the man who should be my enemy.</p> <p>Nothing feels better than getting sweet revenge....</p> <p>Until you fall in love with your target.</p> <p>Start this steamy and thrilling enemies-to-lovers new-adult paranormal romance full of tension, mystery, and intrigue in one human-ish woman’s search for true love.</p> <p>Author's note: <i>Sweet Revenge </i>is an adult dark paranormal romance with some dark themes, possessive males, and adult language. It was originally published on Kindle Vella as <i>Hitched Live</i>. It is set within the world of Azar, along with (in listening order) Hitched, Darkblood Academy, Royally Hitched, Darkblood Prison, Wolfish, Vampish, and Of Gods and Wolves, but it's not necessary to listen to the other series first to enjoy this one.</p>"; 
